 ],
 "sentences": [
  "Eight thirteen in the evening.",
  "Salem, Ohio.",
  "A freight train is passing a factory, and a surveillance camera records a fire under one of its cars.",
  "The twenty-third car, a covered hopper.",
  "The fire is at a wheel, at the bearing on its leading axle.",
  "Moments later the train crosses a hot bearing detector, an infrared sensor beside the track.",
  "It reads that bearing at one hundred and three degrees Fahrenheit above the air temperature.",
  "The line at which the crew would be told to slow down and stop is one hundred and seventy.",
  "So the detector sends an alert.",
  "Not to the train, but to a help desk.",
  "In the cab, nothing."
 ],
